## Outside `projects/`

- `nigeria-documentary/` and `Nigeria_Day1_Initial_Watchlist.md` (root): a documentary project ("Among the Hunted" VFX brief) filed outside the client-workspace structure. Start with `nigeria-documentary/CLAUDE_START_HERE.md`. Ask Andres before moving it into `projects/`.
- `output/imagegen/`: generated images at the root, outside any client folder.
- `shared/knowledge/`: platform spec libraries, ad-reference index, web inspiration sources, awards lessons (Transform Awards NA 2025), Meta Blueprint practices, the Barry reference. References only; verify platform specs before production.
- `validation/`: earlier framework audit evidence. Historical, not tests to rerun.
- `skill-drafts/`: skills in draft, not installed.
- `briefs/` and `outputs/` at the root are superseded by the client workspaces.

## Practical continuation

Make the smallest relevant edit, preserve Andres's work and client boundaries, keep earlier versions beside new ones, and update the project README when a new version or delivery is created. When the system itself changes, keep `CLAUDE.md`, the role `AGENT.md`, its wrapper and the framework registry consistent only where the change requires it. Commit on `handoff` with a short message that names the client and project, and push so the other machine stays in sync.
